  "status": "flush_2026-06-23 (FULL-FACADE texture renders FLUSH — windows.flush:true. The full-facade render is a complete II-C illustration: windows, arched openings, stone sills, fire escapes and cornice are all PAINTED IN. Carving procedural recesses (recessM) over it stamped misaligned wall-toned panes, and sill:true stamped duplicate floating tan sill bars (FACADE_RELIEF.sillLit) — the clutter bug. flush:true keeps the authored rects (for future registration/interaction) but models NO relief: the wall mask covers the openings so the drawing shows, and the recess/sill pass is skipped. Same principle as the cornice de-dup (commit f2608ce) and window-decal-is-flush-not-recessed. The previous center-only recess spec is archived at docs/visual-artifacts/astral-center-derivation/astral-apartments.center-segment-spec.archived.json; it no longer maps because the texture changed from the ~17.9m center segment to the whole 60.6m frontage.)",
